      "observations": [
        "The 12-second view shows Galileo rather than the two MLZ neighbours; do not transfer that vertical facade pattern.",
        "The 28-second view shows an MLZ long outer face with separated upper ribbon windows, an asymmetric middle row, low dark ground-floor groups, stepped flat roof and pale concrete skin.",
